{"content":[{"c":["ZUR"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Midianite prince who was the father of Cozbi, the Midianite woman who was killed by Phinehas for consorting with Zimri after the incident at Baal-peor (",{"href":"?bref=Num.25.15","r":"Num.25.15","rawR":"Num.25.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.25.15","value":"Num.25.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 25:15"},"). He was one of the five “kings” of Midian who (with Balaam) were later killed by the Israelites (",{"href":"?bref=Num.31.8","r":"Num.31.8","rawR":"Num.31.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.31.8","value":"Num.31.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"31:8"},"). Apparently, he was a vassal of the Amorite king Sihon, since he is listed as one of his “princes” (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.13.21","r":"Josh.13.21","rawR":"Josh.13.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.13.21","value":"Josh.13.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 13:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Son of Jeiel, the founder of Gibeon (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.30","r":"1Chr.8.30","rawR":"1Chr.8.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.30","value":"1Chr.8.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:30"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.36","r":"1Chr.9.36","rawR":"1Chr.9.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.36","value":"1Chr.9.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:36"},"). He was a Benjaminite and a distant relative of Saul."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Zur","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 25:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.25.15","rawQueryValue":"Num.25.15","sourceRefExact":"Num.25.15"},{"anchorText":"31:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.31.8","rawQueryValue":"Num.31.8","sourceRefExact":"Num.31.8"},{"anchorText":"Jos 13:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.13.21","rawQueryValue":"Josh.13.21","sourceRefExact":"Josh.13.21"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:30","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.30","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.30","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.30"},{"anchorText":"9:36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.36","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.36","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.36"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0c8fc7b89de5b2af023f5f287bfb59556f0b74725032785fb852f6d7a1f9fd23","sourceItemName":"Zur","sourceItemOrder":160,"sourceMember":"Articles/Z.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Zur","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Zur","title":"Zur","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}